DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-26T04:30:00&endDate=2026-12-30T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nHAMMERSMITH & CITY LINE: Boxing Day\, 26 December to Tuesday 29 December\, no service between Moorgate and Barking. There will also be no DISTRICT LINE service between East Ham and Barking / Upney. c2c services will not operate on Boxing Day but operate between Fenchurch Street\, Limehouse\, West Ham\, Barking and Upminster on other days (no trains to/from Liverpool Street). Replacement bus service DL7 operates between East Ham\, Barking and Upney.
